    <skos:prefLabel>Carbon-intensive built environment</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/interventions-measures-responses"/>
    <skos:definition>Buildings with poor insulation or energy performance that rely on fossil fuel heating and cooling systems, contributing to both emissions and energy poverty.</skos:definition>
