    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/health-outcomes"/>
    <skos:definition>Acute inflammatory liver disease caused by hepatitis A, B, C, D, or E viruses, ranging from self-limiting illness to fulminant hepatic failure.</skos:definition>
