    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://vocab.destiny-evidence.org/health-outcomes"/>
    <skos:definition>Skin infections caused by fungi including dermatophytes (tinea), yeasts (candidiasis), and moulds, particularly prevalent in hot and humid conditions.</skos:definition>
